Package: openmediavault-echo-os
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Echo Project <verify@echo-age.com>
Homepage: https://echo-age.com
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0), openmediavault (<< 9.0), adduser, dpkg, init-system-helpers, python3, systemd, util-linux
XB-Plugin-Section: utilities
XB-Plugin-Architecture: amd64, arm64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: OpenMediaVault Echo OS integration plugin
 Installs the constrained local Unix-socket bridge used by Echo OS to read
 redacted OpenMediaVault storage state and perform narrowly approved SMB and
 filesystem user/group quota transactions. It never formats disks or exposes
 the OpenMediaVault RPC socket to containers.
